   $\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, the point $\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2},\\frac{7\\pi }{4}\\right)$ does **not** lie on the graph of $y=\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x.$\n\n- Finally, we consider the point $\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2},\\frac{3\\pi }{4}\\right).$ We note the following:\n\n- The point $\\left(\\frac{3\\pi }{4},-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)$ lies on the graph of $y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\,✓$\n\n- The range of $y=\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x$ is $y\\in [0,\\pi ],$ and $y=\\frac{3\\pi }{4}$ lies within this range. $\\,✓$\n\nTherefore, the point $\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2},\\frac{3\\pi }{4}\\right)$ lies on the graph of $y=\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186111362 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08aa76b4-af00-5cf5-86f0-d9111d90209b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460137} {:answer/id #uuid "48152d24-ed22-5738-bb6f-a224e33b9cb8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460138}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "08aa76b4-af00-5cf5-86f0-d9111d90209b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460137} :answer-field/id #uuid "ceee4737-1a31-555e-a291-33a7162e80e9" :answer-field/key "$\\left(\\frac{\\pi }{4},1\\right)$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460935} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e2def92a-e98b-544b-8a7e-81a30a765f6a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460139} {:answer/id #uuid "3cae6124-4500-57bb-8c62-a8be4a3fe484" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460140}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3cae6124-4500-57bb-8c62-a8be4a3fe484" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460140} :answer-field/id #uuid "d9ad9f45-e5cf-50e8-b7c8-fa2cf204